<div style="line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif;clear:both">

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;width:100%;text-align:left;color:#000000">
  <tr>
    <td style="width:auto;vertical-align:top;text-align:justify;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif">
        <div style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0)">
        <div style="line-height:1.25">&#160;</div>
        <div style="line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);margin-left:50pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">The
        allowance for credit losses is based on the Company&#8217;s assessment of the collectability of accounts. The Company regularly assessed
        collectability based on a combination of factors, including an assessment of the current customer&#8217;s aging balance, the nature and
        size of the customer, the financial condition of the customer, and future expected economic conditions. Trade receivables deemed uncollectable
        are charged against the allowance for credit losses when identified. As of September 30, 2023, and December 31, 2022, trade receivables
        are presented net of allowance for credit losses in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20231110002137192" name="us-gaap:AllowanceForDoubtfulAccountsReceivableCurrent" contextRef="C_20230930" unitRef="USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">352</ix:nonFraction>&#160;thousand
        and $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20231113154815459" name="us-gaap:AllowanceForDoubtfulAccountsReceivableCurrent" contextRef="C_20221231" unitRef="USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">26</ix:nonFraction>
        thousand, respectively.</span></span></div>
        <div style="line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)">&#160;</div> </div> </td> </tr>
  </table> </div> </div> </ix:nonNumeric> </div>

<div style="line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif"> <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20231113160530996" name="us-gaap:StandardProductWarrantyPolicy" contextRef="C_20230101to20230930" escape="true">

<div>

<div>

<div>

<div style="text-align:justify;line-height:1.25">

<div>

<div>

<div>

<div>

<div>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;width:100%">
