<div style="line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif"> <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20231113160701355" name="us-gaap:EarningsPerSharePolicyTextBlock" contextRef="C_20230101to20230930" escape="true">

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;width:100%;text-align:left;color:#000000">
  <tr>
    <td style="width:20.25pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif">&#160;</td>
    <td style="width:27pt;vertical-align:top;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">g.</span></span></td>
    <td style="width:auto;vertical-align:top;text-align:justify;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif">
        <div style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0)"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0)">Basic
        and diluted net loss per ordinary share:</span></span></span></div>
        <div style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0)">&#160;</div>
        <div style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0)">
        <div style="line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">Basic
        and diluted net loss per share was the same for each period presented as the inclusion of all potential shares of ordinary shares and
        warrants outstanding would have been anti-dilutive.</span></span></div>
        <div style="line-height:1.25">&#160;</div>
        <div style="line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">For
        the nine months ended September 30, 2023 and 2022, the total number of ordinary shares related to the outstanding warrants and share option
        plans aggregated to <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20231110002530862" name="us-gaap:AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount" contextRef="C_20230101to20230930" unitRef="shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">19,463,658</ix:nonFraction>
        and <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20231110002541087" name="us-gaap:AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount" contextRef="C_20220101to20220930" unitRef="shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">19,464,888</ix:nonFraction>,
        respectively, was excluded from the calculations of diluted loss per ordinary share since it would have an anti-dilutive effect.</span></span></div>
        </div> </td> </tr>
  </table> </ix:nonNumeric> </div>

<p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;text-align:center">&#160;</p>

