weighted average grant date fair value of RSUs granted during the nine months ended September 30, 2023, and 2022 was $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20231110005336982" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" contextRef="C_20230101to20230930_usgaapAwardTypeAxis_usgaapRestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" unitRef="USD_per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.87</ix:nonFraction>
and $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20231110005343260" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" contextRef="C_20220101to20220930_usgaapAwardTypeAxis_usgaapRestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" unitRef="USD_per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1.00</ix:nonFraction>,
respectively.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>

<div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif">&#160;</div>

<div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:47.25pt;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span><span><span>As
of September 30, 2023, there were $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20231110005351333" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognized" contextRef="C_20230930_usgaapAwardTypeAxis_usgaapEmployeeStockOptionMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3.1</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million
of total unrecognized compensation costs related to non-vested share-based compensation arrangements granted under the Company's 2014
Plan. This cost is expected to be recognized over a period of approximately <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20231110005357018" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerm1" contextRef="C_20230101to20230930_usgaapAwardTypeAxis_usgaapEmployeeStockOptionMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear">3.0</ix:nonNumeric>
years.</span></span></span></span></span></span></div> </div> </div>

